From: OpenMandriva packaging
Subject: desktop: keep text/x-cst association; fix image/svg MIME

Original mdv patch added text/x-cst to MimeType so .cst schemes open
with crosti. Upstream 1.14.0 already includes text/x-cst; rebase keeps
that association and normalizes image/svg -> image/svg+xml on the same
MimeType line.

--- a/src/crosti.desktop	2014-02-21 19:31:32.000000000 +0100
+++ b/src/crosti.desktop	2026-08-02 16:40:38.672390859 +0200
@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@
 Version=1.0
 Categories=Graphics;2DGraphics;RasterGraphics;
 Exec=crosti %f
-MimeType=text/x-cst;image/bmp;image/gif;image/jpeg;image/png;image/tiff;image/x-portable-bitmap;image/x-portable-graymap;image/x-portable-pixmap;image/x-xbitmap;image/x-xpixmap;image/svg;image/vnd.microsoft.icon;
+MimeType=text/x-cst;image/bmp;image/gif;image/jpeg;image/png;image/tiff;image/x-portable-bitmap;image/x-portable-graymap;image/x-portable-pixmap;image/x-xbitmap;image/x-xpixmap;image/svg+xml;image/vnd.microsoft.icon;
 GenericName=Cross stitch editor
 GenericName[ru]=Редактор схем для вышивания крестом
 Comment=Build your personal cross stitches
